{"id":"23106efbc02dddf0","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-quine-sentence.md","title":"Quine Sentence Example","display":"ex-quine-sentence — Quine Sentence Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-quine-sentence","aliases":["90-ex-quine-sentence"],"display":"ex-quine-sentence — Quine Sentence Example","depends_on":["[[90-df-self-reference]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-quine-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-quine-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-quine-sentence — Quine Sentence Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"af4f7551b0885593\" href=\"?note=af4f7551b0885593\" title=\"90-df-self-reference\">90-df-self-reference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>全部语法与可证性使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同一环境；涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 时，还使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 中已声明的有效公理化证明呈示，不从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 单独推定公理可枚举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory satisfying the diagonal-lemma assumptions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,d\">\\(g,d\\)</span> (effective Gödel numbering and partial decoder)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\)</span> (explicit sufficient assumptions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(1)}\\)</span> (property of quoted sentence codes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\\)</span> (self-reference relation)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}quine\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}quine\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T(\\psi;\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>把给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(v)\">\\(\\varphi(v)\\)</span> 代入 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"34b9d9e028267d9d\" href=\"?note=34b9d9e028267d9d\" title=\"90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal\">90-thm-diagonal-lemma-formal</a>，再用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"af4f7551b0885593\" href=\"?note=af4f7551b0885593\" title=\"90-df-self-reference\">90-df-self-reference</a> 的定义重写其双条件，即得结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{SelfRef}_T\\)</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\">\\(T\\vdash\\psi\\leftrightarrow\\varphi(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>自然语言 Quine 句只是这一固定点模式的直观展示；写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg Q(Q)\">\\(\\neg Q(Q)\\)</span> 会把字符串、谓词与句子混成同一类型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-self-reference","status":"resolved","id":"af4f7551b0885593","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-self-reference]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"t